<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch Hoogovens up on first half results.</title>
<headline>Dutch Hoogovens up on first half results.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Dutch steel and aluminium group Hoogovens NV jumped nearly five percent to a high of 142.30 guilders after the company announced strong first half results for 1997.</p>
<p>The company said net profit for the first half was 194 million guilders against 139 million in the same period of last year. It added that it foresaw a strong rise in full year 1997 profits with scope for price increases in the second half.</p>
<p>Analysts had forecast first half earnings would range between 162 and 205 million guilders.</p>
<p>--Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
